{"instruction":"針對 產線 1 的資料流，使用 qc_check.sh 監控 陶瓷片 門檻 0.75 並通知 dashboard。","input":"{\"node-1\":[{\"name\":\"cut.sh\",\"version\":\"1.2.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"切割機\",\"version\":\"2.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-2\":[{\"name\":\"cnc_job.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.3\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"CNC-03\",\"version\":\"3.1.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-3\":[{\"name\":\"qc_check.sh\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"品質檢測儀\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-4\":[{\"name\":\"report.sh\",\"version\":\"2.3.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"report-svc\",\"version\":\"1.5.0\",\"type\":\"service\"}],\"node-5\":[{\"name\":\"transfer.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.1\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"搬運車\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}]}","output":"{\"steps\":[{\"nodeId\":\"node-3\",\"tool\":\"品質檢測儀\",\"script\":\"qc_check.sh\",\"args\":{\"threshold\":0.75,\"material\":\"陶瓷片\",\"notify\":\"dashboard\"}}],\"supervisorPolicy\":\"fail-fast\"}"}
{"instruction":"請將 sensor-stream 的 JSON 檔案解析後，找出 玻璃基板 相關資料並送到 出貨區。","input":"{\"node-1\":[{\"name\":\"cut.sh\",\"version\":\"1.2.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"切割機\",\"version\":\"2.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-2\":[{\"name\":\"cnc_job.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.3\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"CNC-03\",\"version\":\"3.1.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-3\":[{\"name\":\"qc_check.sh\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"品質檢測儀\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-4\":[{\"name\":\"report.sh\",\"version\":\"2.3.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"report-svc\",\"version\":\"1.5.0\",\"type\":\"service\"}],\"node-5\":[{\"name\":\"transfer.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.1\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"搬運車\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}]}","output":"{\"steps\":[{\"nodeId\":\"node-1\",\"tool\":\"切割機\",\"script\":\"cut.sh\",\"args\":{\"input\":\"sensor-stream.json\",\"keyword\":\"玻璃基板\"}},{\"nodeId\":\"node-2\",\"tool\":\"CNC-03\",\"script\":\"cnc_job.sh\",\"args\":{\"material\":\"玻璃基板\"}},{\"nodeId\":\"node-3\",\"tool\":\"品質檢測儀\",\"script\":\"qc_check.sh\",\"args\":{\"product\":\"玻璃基板\"}},{\"nodeId\":\"node-4\",\"tool\":\"report-svc\",\"script\":\"report.sh\",\"args\":{\"reportType\":\"出貨區\"}},{\"nodeId\":\"node-5\",\"tool\":\"搬運車\",\"script\":\"transfer.sh\",\"args\":{\"destination\":\"出貨區\"}}],\"supervisorPolicy\":\"fail-fast\"}"}
{"instruction":"從 sensor-stream 匯入 橡膠墊片 清單，轉成 JSON 後用 切割機 發佈到 archive-bucket。","input":"{\"node-1\":[{\"name\":\"cut.sh\",\"version\":\"1.2.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"切割機\",\"version\":\"2.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-2\":[{\"name\":\"cnc_job.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.3\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"CNC-03\",\"version\":\"3.1.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-3\":[{\"name\":\"qc_check.sh\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"品質檢測儀\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-4\":[{\"name\":\"report.sh\",\"version\":\"2.3.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"report-svc\",\"version\":\"1.5.0\",\"type\":\"service\"}],\"node-5\":[{\"name\":\"transfer.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.1\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"搬運車\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}]}","output":"{\"steps\":[{\"nodeId\":\"node-1\",\"tool\":\"切割機\",\"script\":\"cut.sh\",\"args\":{\"input\":\"sensor-stream\",\"output\":\"archive-bucket\",\"format\":\"json\",\"material\":\"橡膠墊片\"}}],\"supervisorPolicy\":\"fail-fast\"}"}
{"instruction":"安排 node-5 檢查 鋁合金板 的版本一致性，門檻 0.8，輸出 PDF。","input":"{\"node-1\":[{\"name\":\"cut.sh\",\"version\":\"1.2.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"切割機\",\"version\":\"2.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-2\":[{\"name\":\"cnc_job.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.3\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"CNC-03\",\"version\":\"3.1.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-3\":[{\"name\":\"qc_check.sh\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"品質檢測儀\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}],\"node-4\":[{\"name\":\"report.sh\",\"version\":\"2.3.0\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"report-svc\",\"version\":\"1.5.0\",\"type\":\"service\"}],\"node-5\":[{\"name\":\"transfer.sh\",\"version\":\"1.0.1\",\"type\":\"script\"},{\"name\":\"搬運車\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"type\":\"tool\"}]}","output":"{\"steps\":[{\"nodeId\":\"node-5\",\"tool\":\"搬運車\",\"script\":\"transfer.sh\",\"args\":{\"material\":\"鋁合金板\",\"threshold\":0.8,\"output\":\"PDF\"}}],\"supervisorPolicy\":\"fail-fast\"}"}
